      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY: 1D officers dispatched to the 600 block of North Horners Lane at 3:42 p.m. for the report of a pedestrian struck. \n\nOne adult female pedestrian is being transported to an area hospital with serious injuries. The driver remained on scene.\n\nNorth Horners Lane is closed between Lincoln Avenue and Frederick Avenue. \n\nDrivers are encouraged to expect delays and seek an alternate route.\n\n#MCPNews #MCPD #RoadClosure",
